DESCRIPTION:You have a Django application\, and you've invested loads of ti
 me into carefuly modelling your domain in software. Sure you have might ha
 ve a full blown web app that most users rely on\, but  wouldn't it be nice
  use that same ORM and domain model to have data-informed conversations ab
 out your work with other people in your organisation who might not be pyth
 on devs?\n\nFind out how with by using Marimo and Django to make versatile
 \, pythonic\, lightweight notebooks\, based on lessons from real world use
  of python notebooks and django projects in the real world.
